WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
«I already have ChatGPT.

2
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.600
My sponsor gave me the prompt.»

3
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.610
Fine, use it. But ChatGPT starts from zero every time.

4
00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.720
You have to explain again who the person is, what you said to each other,

5
00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:14.070
where you're at. And it never writes to you first.

6
00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:16.590
RelAI already knows where you left off,

7
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:19.360
with everyone. It remembers every reply.

8
00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.210
It knows when it's time to follow up.

9
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:22.990
And inside it doesn't have a prompt:

10
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.020
it has a network method.

11
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.120
ChatGPT answers.

12
00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.920
RelAI remembers.
